The IR doesn’t expose `option_read`/`meta_read` for CartFlows, so I’m treating it as incomplete and using it mainly to locate write legs. I’m now ranking only those storage writes that share an entry point with real user-controlled sources, then I’ll verify the read legs directly in source.
